UnrealEventCam
==============

The event-generation model in this plugin (Source/UnrealEventCam/Public/
EventSimulator.h and Private/EventSimulator.cpp) is a port of the EventSimulator
from ESIM (rpg_esim) by the Robotics and Perception Group, University of Zurich,
and is used and redistributed here under the terms of its MIT License, reproduced
in full below. The surrounding Unreal integration (frame capture, GPU readback,
TCP streaming, the UActorComponent) is original to this repository and is offered
under the same MIT terms.

Upstream: https://github.com/uzh-rpg/rpg_esim


